  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Berridge Spencer is a New Zealand investor and heir to the Caxton paper fortune built by his family. The son of John Spencer, he directs family investment interests through Clime and Windhaven. His businesses span private equity, property and wine, including Man O' War vineyards and a substantial Devonport commercial-property portfolio.",
